WEBVTT


00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.300
Noticing nature and bird watching can help to slow you down

00:00:03.301 --> 00:00:07.780
because you have to learn to be slower in order to notice the sounds,

00:00:07.781 --> 00:00:10.446
the flapping of the wings, the rustle in the trees 

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:12.980
What makes Flock unique is that

00:00:12.981 --> 00:00:16.128
at the same time as being a Black founded collective

00:00:16.129 --> 00:00:17.977
for a global majority of people,

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:20.320
challenging underrepresentation in the outdoors,

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:22.311
it also creatively brings people from

00:00:22.312 --> 00:00:24.240
all walks of life on the journey,

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:25.480
which is incredible

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:29.540
I think Flock Together has reframed birdwatching as super cool,

00:00:29.541 --> 00:00:31.185
and it's welcomed a lot of people

00:00:31.186 --> 00:00:32.980
who might not have had it on their radar

00:00:32.981 --> 00:00:35.080
 into the space where they belong,

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:37.520
and yet it's really hopeful for the future 
